# The touch controller reports landscape coordinates (1280x720). The panel is portrait.
# KWin applies the panel_orientation rotation to touch input too. Without this matrix, X and Y swap.
# The matrix maps touch input to portrait panel coordinates, as DRM expects.
# Source: switch-touch-rules 1.3 from switchroot (https://gitlab.com/switchroot/switch-l4t-configs)
ACTION=="add|change", SUBSYSTEM=="input", KERNEL=="event*", ATTRS{name}=="stmfts", ENV{LIBINPUT_CALIBRATION_MATRIX}="0 1 0 -1 0 1"
